{"recordedAt":1791956124608,"type":"event","event":{"state":"success","ts":1791956124589,"context":0.11555,"detail":"Agent stopped","source":"claude-code","agent":"demo-report-en-1","name":"tiny-quest","hook":"Stop","terminal":"demo-report-en-2","project":"tiny-quest","text":"I fixed the three bugs and added the three tests. `npm test` ran once: 6 tests, 6 passed, 0 failed.\n\n- **Fixes:** each function now adds instead of subtracting. `reward` returns `coins + bonus`, `slots` returns `items + extra`, and `heal` returns `Math.min(100, hp + potion)`.\n- **New tests:**\n  - `reward(4,0) === 4`\n  - `slots(3,0) === 3`\n  - `heal(100,50) === 100`, which checks the 100 cap\n\nI used one Explore agent to read the files without changing them. A hook blocked its shell commands, so it read the files with the Read tool instead. Everything stayed inside the demo folder, with no network use, commits or other subagents."},"at":1791956124589}
